{"id":"word:hebrew:H769","type":"word","title":"אַרְנוֹן","subtitle":"H769 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"the Arnon , a river east of the Jordan, also its territory","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אַרְנוֹן (H769) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-loc.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 25 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אַרְנוֹן (ʼArnôwn) means the Arnon , a river east of the Jordan, also its territory First listed occurrence: 2Kgs 10 33."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אַרְנוֹן","transliteration":"ʼArnôwn","pronunciation":"ar-nohn'","strong":"H769","lemmaId":"hebrew:H769","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-loc","forms":["אַרְנֹ֔ן","אַרְנוֹן֙","אַרְנ֜וֹן","אַרְנֹֽן","אַרְנֹן֒"],"morphs":[["HNp",20],["HR/Np",5]]},"definitions":{"short":"the Arnon , a river east of the Jordan, also its territory","usage":"Arnon.","full":"H769. Arnon אַרְנֹן אַרְנוֺן, proper name, of a river Arnon , wady & stream in Moab (MI ארנן , Thes Add Rob Ges MV derive from רנן , i.e. the rushing, roaring stream) — אַרְנוֺן Num 21:13 (twice in verse) + 12 t., אַרְנֹן 21:14 10 t. — called boundary between Moab & Amorites 21:13 ; Judg 11:18 , 22 compare גְּבוּלאַרְנֹן Num 22:36 ; often אֵרְנֹן נַחַל Deut 2:24 , 36 ; 3:8 , 12 , 16 ; 4:48 ; 2Kin 10:33 ; ׳נ אַרְנוֺן Josh 12:1-2 , 13:9 , 16 ; אַרְנוֺן הַנְּחָלִים Num 21:14 , i.e. the stream-ravines that unite to form Arnon, compare Di; also אַרְנֹן בָּמוֺת heights of Arnon 21:28 ; אַרְנוֺן מעברות fords of Arnon Isa 16:2 ; elsewhere Num 21:13 , 24 , 26 ; Judg 11:13 , 18 , 26 ; synonym of Moab Jer 48:20 ; (compare Tristr Moab 125 f. ; modern Môjib ). II. ארן (√ assumed for following word, compare Sta § 208 c ; Dl Pr 125 argues for √ ארה (so Thes), on ground of an Assyrian êrû , synonym of êrênu ).","rootNote":"or אַרְנֹן lemma אַרְנן missing vowel, corrected to אַרְנֹן ; from 7442 ; a brawling stream;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Kgs 10 33","keyReferences":["2Kgs 10 33","Deut 2 24","Deut 2 36","Deut 3 8","Deut 3 12","Deut 3 16","Deut 4 48","Isa 16 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":25,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Kgs 10 33","book":"2Kgs","chapter":10,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנֹ֔ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Deut 2 24","book":"Deut","chapter":2,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנֹן֒","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Deut 2 36","book":"Deut","chapter":2,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנֹ֜ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Deut 3 8","book":"Deut","chapter":3,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנֹ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Deut 3 12","book":"Deut","chapter":3,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנֹ֗ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Deut 3 16","book":"Deut","chapter":3,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנֹ֔ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Deut 4 48","book":"Deut","chapter":4,"verse":48,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנֹ֛ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Isa 16 2","book":"Isa","chapter":16,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/אַרְנֽוֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"Jer 48 20","book":"Jer","chapter":48,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְ/אַרְנ֔וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"Josh 12 1","book":"Josh","chapter":12,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנוֹן֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Josh 12 2","book":"Josh","chapter":12,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנ֜וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Josh 13 9","book":"Josh","chapter":13,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְנ֜וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Josh 13 16","book":"Josh","chapter":13,"verse":1